PART I — OPEN-CORE COMMUNITY EDITION (DUAL AGPLv3 / MIT)
================================================================================

The Open-Core Community components of PhasorWave — explicitly limited to:
  1. The unified SIMD platform abstraction header (`include/simd_platform.hpp`)
  2. The base complex I/Q vector kernel (`include/phy_simd.hpp`, `src/phy_simd.cpp`)
  3. The Community WebAssembly simulator UI (`frontend/`) and Community WASM
     wrappers (`wasm_simd_complex_multiply`, `wasm_community_fspl_atten`, and
     diagonal low-order Volterra K<=3, M<=2, L=0 in `src/wasm_bindings.cpp`)
  4. Reproducible benchmark and accuracy validation scripts (`benchmarks/`)

