5. 14-Day Refund Policy
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Commercial license purchases (Pro and Enterprise tiers) processed through
PhasorWave's Merchant of Record, Lemon Squeezy, are covered by a fourteen (14)
calendar-day, no-questions-asked full refund policy measured from the original
date of purchase.

Licensee may request a full refund within fourteen (14) calendar days of
purchase if the Commercial Software does not meet Licensee's technical
expectations or presents hardware or platform incompatibilities (for example,
host CPUs lacking mandatory x86-64 AVX2 + FMA3 instruction-set support).

To exercise this refund right within the 14-day window, Licensee may either:
  (a) Contact PhasorWave Licensing Support at licenses@phasorwave.dev (quoting
      the purchase email and Lemon Squeezy order ID); or
  (b) Request and manage the refund directly through Lemon Squeezy (via the
      order receipt or Lemon Squeezy customer portal).

Upon refund processing, the corresponding commercial license grant terminates
immediately, the issued `.lic` cryptographic license key is permanently
revoked and invalidated, and Licensee must immediately cease all use of the
Commercial Software and destroy all copies of the revoked `.lic` token and
proprietary binaries.

